{"seq":1,"slug":"fruit-tree-biology","title":"大学园艺学 — 果树生物学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/fruit-science/fruit-tree-biology","wordCount":1752,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学园艺学-果树生物学\">大学园艺学 — 果树生物学</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>果树生物学研究果树的生长发育规律，包括营养生长与生殖生长的交替、花芽分化与坐果机制、树体结构与光合产物分配等核心问题。与一年生作物不同，果树是多年生木本植物，具有幼年期长、经济寿命跨越数十年、营养生长与生殖生长矛盾突出等特点。</p>\n<p>深入理解果树的生命周期特征和器官发育规律，是制定修剪、施肥、疏花疏果等栽培管理措施的科学基础。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"果树的生命周期\">果树的生命周期</h3><p>果树的一生可以划分为四个阶段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>苹果</th>\n<th>柑橘</th>\n<th>桃</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>幼树期</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\text{-}7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n<td>营养生长旺盛，不结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>初果期</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>12</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7\\text{-}12</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\text{-}10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n<td>开始结果，产量递增</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>盛果期</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>35</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12\\text{-}35</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\text{-}40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\text{-}15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n<td>高产稳产</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>衰老期</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;35</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 年</td>\n<td>产量下降，枝条枯死增多</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>幼树期的长短是果树经济性的关键。通过矮化砧木、促花技术和高密度栽培可显著缩短幼树期。苹果矮化砧木 M9 可使初果期提前到定植后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 年。</p>\n<h3 id=\"年生长周期\">年生长周期</h3><p>温带落叶果树的年周期包括<strong>休眠期</strong>和<strong>生长期</strong>两大阶段：</p>\n<p><strong>休眠期</strong>（秋末至早春）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>自然休眠（内休眠）</strong>：由内源信号（ABA 积累、日照变短）触发，即使环境条件适宜也不能萌芽。需要一定量的低温（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>7.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\text{-}7.2°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">7.2°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span>）积累才能解除，称为<strong>需冷量</strong></li>\n<li>苹果需冷量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>800</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>1500</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">800\\text{-}1500</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">800</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1500</span></span></span></span></span> 小时</li>\n<li>桃需冷量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>400</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">400\\text{-}1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 小时</li>\n<li>葡萄需冷量：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>400</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\text{-}400</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">400</span></span></span></span></span> 小时</li>\n</ul>\n<p>需冷量可用犹他模型量化，不同温度的有效值不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>温度范围</th>\n<th>冷量单位（CU）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;1.5°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>2.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5\\text{-}2.4°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2.4°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>9.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.5\\text{-}9.1°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">9.1°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9.2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>12.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9.2\\text{-}12.4°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9.2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">12.4°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12.5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>15.9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12.5\\text{-}15.9°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">15.9°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>16</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;16°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-0.5\\text{-}-1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>生长期</strong>（春季至秋季）：依次经历萌芽展叶→开花坐果→新梢生长→果实膨大→花芽分化→果实成熟→落叶进入休眠。各物候期的持续时间受气温积温控制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"花芽分化\">花芽分化</h3><p>花芽分化是果树从营养生长转向生殖生长的关键转变。分化过程包括生理分化期（不可见的生化变化）和形态分化期（可在显微镜下观察到的花器官原基形成）。</p>\n<p>苹果花芽分化的时间：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>生理分化期</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mtext>新梢停止生长后 </mtext><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn><mtext> 周</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{生理分化期} \\approx \\text{新梢停止生长后 } 2\\text{-}3 \\text{ 周}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">生理分化期</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">新梢停止生长后</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">周</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>形态分化期</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>8</mn><mtext> 月（北半球）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{形态分化期} \\approx 6\\text{-}8 \\text{ 月（北半球）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">形态分化期</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">月（北半球）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>促进花芽分化的因素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>碳氮比（C/N）高</strong>：充足光合产物积累 + 适度控氮</li>\n<li><strong>适度水分胁迫</strong>：减少新梢旺长</li>\n<li><strong>植物激素</strong>：细胞分裂素促进，赤霉素抑制</li>\n<li><strong>环剥或刻芽</strong>：阻断同化物向下运输，局部积累</li>\n</ul>\n<p>碳氮比学说认为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>C（碳水化合物）</mtext><mtext>N（含氮化合物）</mtext></mfrac><mo>↑</mo><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>有利于花芽分化</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{C（碳水化合物）}}{\\text{N（含氮化合物）}} \\uparrow \\Rightarrow \\text{有利于花芽分化}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">N</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（含氮化合物）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（碳水化合物）</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">↑⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有利于花芽分化</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>但这一理论过于简化，现代观点认为激素平衡（特别是 GA/CTK 比）才是直接调控因子。</p>\n<h3 id=\"果实发育与成熟\">果实发育与成熟</h3><p>果实发育一般遵循<strong>S型生长曲线</strong>，核果（桃、樱桃）则呈<strong>双S型</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>第一快速期</strong>：细胞分裂和初期膨大</li>\n<li><strong>硬核期（核果特有）</strong>：果核硬化，果肉生长暂停</li>\n<li><strong>第二快速期</strong>：细胞膨大为主，果实迅速增大</li>\n</ul>\n<p>果实大小由细胞数量和细胞体积共同决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>果实体积</mtext><mo>∝</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>cell</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>cell</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{果实体积} \\propto N_{\\text{cell}} \\times V_{\\text{cell}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">果实体积</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cell</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cell</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>花后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 周是细胞分裂高峰期，此时的营养供给和留果量直接影响最终果实大小。这是<strong>早期疏果</strong>比晚期疏果效果更好的生理学依据。</p>\n<p>果实成熟分为<strong>跃变型</strong>（苹果、香蕉、番茄）和<strong>非跃变型</strong>（柑橘、葡萄、草莓）。跃变型果实在成熟时出现呼吸速率和乙烯释放量的突然升高（呼吸跃变）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>呼吸跃变期：</mtext><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>k</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{呼吸跃变期：} R = R_{\\min} \\times k \\quad (k = 2\\text{-}5)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">呼吸跃变期：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>乙烯是跃变型果实成熟的信号分子，外施乙烯利可催熟，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>1-MCP</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{1-MCP}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1-MCP</span></span></span></span></span></span> 可延缓成熟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"根系生物学\">根系生物学</h3><p>果树根系分布范围远大于树冠投影面积。苹果根系水平分布半径可达树冠半径的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5\\text{-}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 倍，垂直分布主要集中在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>60</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20\\text{-}60\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 土层。</p>\n<p>根系生长与地上部存在<strong>交替生长</strong>现象：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>春季展叶期：新梢旺盛生长，根系生长受抑</li>\n<li>新梢停长后：出现第一次根系生长高峰</li>\n<li>秋季果实采收后：第二次根系生长高峰</li>\n</ul>\n<p>了解根系生长节律对确定施肥时期至关重要：追肥应在根系活跃吸收期之前进行，使养分在根系生长高峰时到位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>某苹果园位于北纬 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>35</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">35°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">35°</span></span></span></span></span>，冬季 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>7.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0\\text{-}7.2°\\text{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">7.2°</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span></span></span></span></span> 的累计时长约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>600</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">600</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span></span></span></span></span> 小时。如果种植需冷量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 小时的品种会出现什么问题？推荐使用什么措施？</li>\n<li>解释为什么果园中新栽幼树不应在第一年就让其大量结果。从碳分配和树体建造的角度分析。</li>\n<li>桃果实呈双 S 型生长曲线，硬核期果肉几乎不膨大。如果在硬核期大量灌水施肥，对果实品质和树体有何影响？</li>\n<li>比较矮化密植和乔化稀植两种苹果栽培模式在光能利用、早期收益和管理复杂度方面的优劣。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>了解<strong>果树基因组</strong>研究进展，特别是苹果和柑橘的全基因组测序和功能基因挖掘</li>\n<li>研究<strong>果实品质形成的分子调控</strong>机制，包括糖酸积累和风味物质合成</li>\n<li>探索<strong>全球变暖对果树需冷量满足度</strong>的影响预测及适应策略</li>\n<li>阅读关于<strong>果树根系微生物组</strong>与树体健康关系的最新研究</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>果树生物学是果树栽培管理的理论基础。从生命周期的四个阶段到年周期的物候节律，从花芽分化的激素调控到果实发育的细胞学过程，每一个知识点都与具体的栽培措施紧密关联。需冷量决定了品种的区域适应性，碳氮比和激素平衡影响花芽分化，细胞分裂期的管理决定果实大小，根系生长节律指导施肥时期。将生物学原理与田间实践结合，是实现优质高产果园管理的关键。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学园艺学 — 果树生物学","id":"大学园艺学-果树生物学"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"果树的生命周期","id":"果树的生命周期"},{"level":3,"text":"年生长周期","id":"年生长周期"},{"level":3,"text":"花芽分化","id":"花芽分化"},{"level":3,"text":"果实发育与成熟","id":"果实发育与成熟"},{"level":3,"text":"根系生物学","id":"根系生物学"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学园艺学 — 无土栽培","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/vegetable-science/soilless-culture"},"next":{"title":"大学园艺学 — 整形修剪","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/horticulture/fruit-science/pruning-training"}}